        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akisicanet ŋina a ŋaarei: Ŋakidodoka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Ekapolon neni a Moses, “Ape neni a Parao tolimok iŋes atemar ŋakiro ŋuna irworo Ekapolon ikes nu, kimyek ŋituŋa kaŋ toloto, ikotere ilipete neni kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani pa kicamak iyoŋ ikes toloto, ekesicani ayoŋ iyoŋ, elelebikini ŋakidodoka nakwap kon daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eburusiyarete ŋakidodoka aŋolol; epete tari kai kon ŋina ka apukan, epete tari nagule kon ka lokitaada kon. Epete tari nakais a ŋikapolok a ŋulu ipukatotor iyoŋ ka nakais ŋuna a ŋituŋa kon; epete tari lokenoi ka loboro ŋulu emunaere ŋakirya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikidokakinete iyoŋ ŋakidodoka ka edokakinete tari neni a ŋituŋa kon ka neni a ŋikapolok a ŋulu ipukatotor iyoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Ekapolon neni a Moses, “Tolimok Aron atemar kikyaa akan keŋ etiŋit ebela keŋ alokidiama ŋaŋololin, ŋakitelesyo ka ŋataparin, ikotere tolomut ŋakidodoka a nen toyakaun nakwap a Ijipit. ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Aron kikyaa akan keŋ kidiama ŋakipi ŋuna aya nakwap a Ijipit; ido apotu ŋakidodoka tolomut a nen pena nakwap a Ijipit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu ŋikekukujak daŋ kitiyata ŋakujuwuanisya ŋunapei ŋun aloticisyo kec a ŋulu pa apatana ayenun; kitolomut ŋakidodoka anakwap a Ijipit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Parao tonyarau Moses ka Aron tema, “Kilipa neni a Ekapolon tolema ŋakidodoka aneni kaŋ ka alotuŋa kaŋ, ido emyekini ayoŋ Ŋisirael toloto kitiyata amuronot neni a Ekapolon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Moses neni a Parao, “Anarimao kon, tolimokinae ayoŋ apaki ŋina emaikina elipya aŋuna kon ka aŋuna a ŋikapolok a ŋulu ipukato ka iyoŋ ta ŋituŋa kon, ikotere elemaryo ŋakidodoka aneni kon ka anakais kus, kidoŋo eya naŋolol Nile bon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Parao, “Moi taparacu.” Tema Moses, “Etiyae ayoŋ ikwapei ilimunio iyoŋ! Aŋuna ka akitaanyun iyoŋ atemar, mam ituŋanan epedoryo akisikwaanikin ka Ekapolon Akuj kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erotokinete ŋakidodoka aneni kon ka anakais kus aneni a ŋikapolok a ŋulu ipukatotor iyoŋ ka alotuŋa kon, nai idoŋete eyakasi naŋolol Nile bon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Torotokis nai Moses ka Aron aneni a Parao; kigworonok Moses Ekapolon aŋuna a ŋakidodoka a ŋuna abu Ekapolon yau neni a Parao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Ekapolon kitiya ŋuna eŋita Moses ka apotu ŋakidodoka totwaka anakais ka anenilapat alokidiŋ ŋakais ta alomanikorin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totukonokis ŋituŋa ŋakidodoka ŋuna apotu kitobosut akwap ŋin tul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani eanyuni Parao atemar eeŋa iŋes alocan a ŋul, abu kitogogoŋ akou keŋ; nyepupok ŋakiro ŋuna erworosi Moses ka Aron ka abu kitiya lopite ŋolo sek alimunitor Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akisicanet ŋina a ŋauni: Ŋilac",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Ekapolon neni a Moses, “Tolimok Aron atemar kikyaa ebela keŋ, toram ŋalup topuruu apuwa, ikotere apuwa ŋin eruwor ŋilac anakwap a Ijipit a daadaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ata Moses kitiyata ŋun; abu Aron kikyaa akan keŋ etiŋit ebela keŋ, toram ŋalup topuruu apuwa ŋina abu toruwor ŋilac ŋulu apotu pena lotuŋa ka lobaren daŋ toruwor apuwa a akwap a Ijipit a daadaŋ ŋilac bon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikatakis ŋikekukujak a Ijipit aloticisyo kec a ŋulu pa apatana ayenun akitiya akujuwuanut ŋinakitolomunet ŋilac, nai apotu nyepedosi. Apotu ŋilac pena lotuŋa ka lobaren daŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Temasi ŋikekukujak neni a Parao, “Akuj etiya ŋakiro nu a akan keŋ!” Nai abu Parao torubak itogogoŋit akou keŋ, abu nyepupok ŋakiro ata Moses ka abu kitiya lopite ŋolo sek alimunitor Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akisicanet ŋina a ŋaomwon: Ŋicuc",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Ekapolon neni a Moses, “Tonyou moi taparacu eriŋa ataparacu kitoodiyar neni a Parao apaki ŋina elomarya iŋes kiŋa nakipi a aŋolol Nile, tolimok iŋes atemar ŋakiro ŋuna irworo Ekapolon ikes nu, kimyek ŋituŋa kaŋ toloto, ikotere ilipete neni kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani pa kicamak iyoŋ ikes toloto, eyakuuni ayoŋ ŋicuc ŋulu alalak nooi neni kon, neni a ŋikapolok a ŋulu ipukato ka iyoŋ, lotuŋa kon, ka nakais kus; ilelebun ŋicuc ŋulu alalak nooi nakais a Ŋijipitian ka akwap kec daadaŋ neni iboiyoto ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai akoloŋit ŋin, nyepete ŋicuc ŋul nakwap a Gosen, neni iboiyoto ŋituŋa kaŋ, ŋun nai ikitoodikinete iyoŋ atemar ayoŋ Ekapolon ayakar apedor anakwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eketaanyikini ayoŋ iyoŋ atyeketait ŋina eyai kidiŋ ŋituŋa kaŋ ka ŋulu kon. Etakanuni akujuwuanut ŋin moi taparacu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon kitiya ŋun, toyakaun ŋicuc ŋulu alalak nooi kai a Parao ka nakais a ŋikapolok a ŋulu epukatotor iŋes, tomunaut ŋicuc akwap a Ijipit daadaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonyarau nai Parao Moses ka Aron tema “Apesi inakisi amuronot neni ka Akuj kus. Kitiyata ŋun anakwap anapei a na.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu Moses tema neni a Parao, “Nyemaikina isua akitiya ŋun; anerae ŋamuronisya ŋuna einanakinio isua neni a Ekapolon Akuj kosi, erae ibore ŋini nyitalakarit Ŋijipitian. Ani kelemun isua ŋamuronisya ŋun, inakinae neni ke Ekapolon Akuj kosi iteete Ŋijipitian ikicakete isua Ŋijipitian a ŋamoru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina isua kisyakinae alosit kosi ŋina a ŋirwa a ŋiuni analoŋisat, ido oinakisi ŋamuronisya neni a Ekapolon Akuj kosi ikwapei ikicikakinitere isua.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Parao tema, “Ekemyekini ayoŋ iyes toloto inakis ŋamuronisya neni a Ekapolon Akuj kus analoŋisat, erae ca pa kiloto iyes neni elwana nooi. Kilipakinae ayoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Moses, “Arotokin ayoŋ aneni kon bon, elipi ayoŋ neni a Ekapolon, ikotere ŋicuc torotokis moi taparacu aneni a Parao, aneni a ŋikapolok a ŋulu ipukatotor iŋes ka alotuŋa keŋ. Nai emaikina iyoŋ Parao nyilyokon, towou akimyekin Ŋisirael toloto ainakin ŋamuronisya neni a Ekapolon.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
