          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Moses toloma kiŋa aneni ayai Parao, ido kilip neni a Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Ekapolon kitiya lopite ŋolo eŋitar Moses: Tolema ŋicuc aneni a Parao, aneni a ŋikapolok a ŋulu epukatotor Parao ka alotuŋa a Parao; mam epei daŋ abu kidoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
